{"4235060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Foolz", "steam_appid": 4235060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MyNotes:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is an internal Steam page and is still a work in progress. It needs polishing before publishing.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dr.P do not publish before polishing it!!!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >watch a tutorial online on how to publish.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FOOLz is an online co-op  focused on survival, base building, and physics-driven mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/b592b8e8f0ce8a1a31cc326772c1ae64.poster.avif?t=1778612762\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/b592b8e8f0ce8a1a31cc326772c1ae64.webm?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/b592b8e8f0ce8a1a31cc326772c1ae64.mp4?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT TO DEFEND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You defend a fragile Stone Age village while exploring a low-poly prehistoric world filled with dinos, monsters, and unpredictable systems. Gather resources and build defenses to keep the village standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/accb324d809bd4abc61729aa0598641e.poster.avif?t=1778612762\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/accb324d809bd4abc61729aa0598641e.webm?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/accb324d809bd4abc61729aa0598641e.mp4?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PERFORM RITUAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient rituals allow you to reincarnate powerful heroes. Escort massive, physics-based dino eggs to ritual sites, explore the world to collect star fragments, and activate ceremonies that attract waves of monsters determined to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/2a3fb2d6fc7f07e53103267a82e26f9b.poster.avif?t=1778612762\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/2a3fb2d6fc7f07e53103267a82e26f9b.webm?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/2a3fb2d6fc7f07e53103267a82e26f9b.mp4?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REINCARNATE CRAZY HEROS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successful rituals bring legendary protectors into the world, dramatically shifting the battlefield with powerful area attacks and crowd control. Additional heroes will become available through future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/ce845a0d1428f7900eadda77c7d5e4a7.poster.avif?t=1778612762\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/ce845a0d1428f7900eadda77c7d5e4a7.webm?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/ce845a0d1428f7900eadda77c7d5e4a7.mp4?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORK TOGETHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly fire is always on, physics drives every interaction, plans fail spectacularly, and survival often depends as much on your friends as your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/fb21dce501d93180c93df4122b225f1b.poster.avif?t=1778612762\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/fb21dce501d93180c93df4122b225f1b.webm?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/fb21dce501d93180c93df4122b225f1b.mp4?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MyNotes:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is an internal Steam page and is still a work in progress. It needs polishing before publishing.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dr.P do not publish before polishing it!!!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >watch a tutorial online on how to publish.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FOOLz is an online co-op  focused on survival, base building, and physics-driven mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/b592b8e8f0ce8a1a31cc326772c1ae64.poster.avif?t=1778612762\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/b592b8e8f0ce8a1a31cc326772c1ae64.webm?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/b592b8e8f0ce8a1a31cc326772c1ae64.mp4?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT TO DEFEND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You defend a fragile Stone Age village while exploring a low-poly prehistoric world filled with dinos, monsters, and unpredictable systems. Gather resources and build defenses to keep the village standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/accb324d809bd4abc61729aa0598641e.poster.avif?t=1778612762\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/accb324d809bd4abc61729aa0598641e.webm?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/accb324d809bd4abc61729aa0598641e.mp4?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PERFORM RITUAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient rituals allow you to reincarnate powerful heroes. Escort massive, physics-based dino eggs to ritual sites, explore the world to collect star fragments, and activate ceremonies that attract waves of monsters determined to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/2a3fb2d6fc7f07e53103267a82e26f9b.poster.avif?t=1778612762\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/2a3fb2d6fc7f07e53103267a82e26f9b.webm?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/2a3fb2d6fc7f07e53103267a82e26f9b.mp4?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REINCARNATE CRAZY HEROS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successful rituals bring legendary protectors into the world, dramatically shifting the battlefield with powerful area attacks and crowd control. Additional heroes will become available through future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/ce845a0d1428f7900eadda77c7d5e4a7.poster.avif?t=1778612762\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/ce845a0d1428f7900eadda77c7d5e4a7.webm?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/ce845a0d1428f7900eadda77c7d5e4a7.mp4?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORK TOGETHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly fire is always on, physics drives every interaction, plans fail spectacularly, and survival often depends as much on your friends as your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/fb21dce501d93180c93df4122b225f1b.poster.avif?t=1778612762\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/fb21dce501d93180c93df4122b225f1b.webm?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/extras/fb21dce501d93180c93df4122b225f1b.mp4?t=1778612762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p>", "short_description": "FOOLz is a co-op Stone Age experience where defending a village means fighting enemies, the environment, and your own bad decisions.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/a6c3c0e7ec7369f8f50a3efd887f917d4897f626/header.jpg?t=1778612762", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/100eca008e5a85e4c62936ea22ff2d0a334a738c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778612762", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235060/100eca008e5a85e4c62936ea22ff2d0a334a738c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778612762", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i7-3820 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia 970 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3000 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 9 3900XT or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia 3060 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3000 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul